(7529368, 1203883, 38032, '<td valign="top">nice! I think the images that work best for me in this challenge seem more like conventional images rather than negatives. This works well because you are creating a sort of illusion in the mind -  as if the shadow has become a physical thing or a neon light. Actually I''m not even sure it is a shadow.</td>', 'nice! I think the images that work best for me in this challenge seem more like conventional images rather than negatives. This works well because you are creating a sort of illusion in the mind -  as if the shadow has become a physical thing or a neon light. Actually I''m not even sure it is a shadow.', '2017-08-17 09:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
