(7529408, 1203916, 173844, '<td valign="top">A wild melange that somehow hangs together and works for me.  Don''t know, kind of at a loss for words.  One of three favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'A wild melange that somehow hangs together and works for me.  Don''t know, kind of at a loss for words.  One of three favorites in the challenge.', '2017-08-17 16:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529410, 1203865, 173844, '<td valign="top">So forcefully done in bringing the dark before light into light before dark.  A lone theater-goer taking in a chaotic, almost dystopian scene.  Wonderful colors, the blue of the water(?), the flamingo pink of the chair.  The down-tilted head just makes me more curious.  Outstanding.  One of three favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'So forcefully done in bringing the dark before light into light before dark.  A lone theater-goer taking in a chaotic, almost dystopian scene.  Wonderful colors, the blue of the water(?), the flamingo pink of the chair.  The down-tilted head just makes me more curious.  Outstanding.  One of three favorites in the challenge.', '2017-08-17 16:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529411, 1203912, 173844, '<td valign="top">This lovely image has the delicacy and introspection of a Japanese watercolor.  The details are exquisite.  That pink nose now tinged green.  Poetry.  One of three favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'This lovely image has the delicacy and introspection of a Japanese watercolor.  The details are exquisite.  That pink nose now tinged green.  Poetry.  One of three favorites in the challenge.', '2017-08-17 17:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529412, 1203956, 173844, '<td valign="top">The wonderful flock of birds in the background, behind a resting pigeon, is an amazing vision.  Did you notice this as you took the shot?  It''s delight drawn out of our everyday world, like scarves out of a magician''s hat.  Many kudos.</td>', 'The wonderful flock of birds in the background, behind a resting pigeon, is an amazing vision.  Did you notice this as you took the shot?  It''s delight drawn out of our everyday world, like scarves out of a magician''s hat.  Many kudos.', '2017-08-17 17:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529413, 1203887, 173844, '<td valign="top">Here it really feels like the world has turned upside down, and it works so well.  That huge cloud is a wonder, both serene and threatening.  Perfectly peopled with silhouette figures off signage.  Fine image.</td>', 'Here it really feels like the world has turned upside down, and it works so well.  That huge cloud is a wonder, both serene and threatening.  Perfectly peopled with silhouette figures off signage.  Fine image.', '2017-08-17 17:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529418, 1203683, 61396, '<td valign="top">a lot to see</td>', 'a lot to see', '2017-08-17 18:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529419, 1203769, 61396, '<td valign="top">nice thought</td>', 'nice thought', '2017-08-17 18:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529420, 1203670, 173844, '<td valign="top">The duplicated downwards lines on the left so mindful of Chinese characters drew me to see the whole image in this Oriental fashion.  Maybe it''s digital calligraphy.  Without any idea of what I''m looking at, I like it a lot.  Go figure.</td>', 'The duplicated downwards lines on the left so mindful of Chinese characters drew me to see the whole image in this Oriental fashion.  Maybe it''s digital calligraphy.  Without any idea of what I''m looking at, I like it a lot.  Go figure.', '2017-08-17 18:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529421, 1203691, 61396, '<td valign="top">nicely done</td>', 'nicely done', '2017-08-17 18:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529422, 1203885, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like the expressionist touch</td>', 'I like the expressionist touch', '2017-08-17 18:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529423, 1203865, 61396, '<td valign="top">nicely put</td>', 'nicely put', '2017-08-17 18:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529424, 1203875, 61396, '<td valign="top">taken</td>', 'taken', '2017-08-17 18:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529425, 1203782, 61396, '<td valign="top">pretty bold</td>', 'pretty bold', '2017-08-17 18:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529426, 1203885, 173844, '<td valign="top">A charming, pretty, theatrical image.  The figure seems to have grown out of the forest from which she''s emerging.  However it''s been processed to achieve this look is very effective.  Fine work.</td>', 'A charming, pretty, theatrical image.  The figure seems to have grown out of the forest from which she''s emerging.  However it''s been processed to achieve this look is very effective.  Fine work.', '2017-08-17 18:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529428, 1203915, 173844, '<td valign="top">The way these buds and flowers have been slanted to fill the landscape orientation gives it panache and vivacity.  Altogether elegant and nicely composed.</td>', 'The way these buds and flowers have been slanted to fill the landscape orientation gives it panache and vivacity.  Altogether elegant and nicely composed.', '2017-08-17 18:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529430, 1203870, 173844, '<td valign="top">But for the inky sky and purple trees a carnival scene such as this could very well exist in the noninverted world.  That''s part of the charm here, along with the generally visually raucous atmosphere.  Very enjoyable.</td>', 'But for the inky sky and purple trees a carnival scene such as this could very well exist in the noninverted world.  That''s part of the charm here, along with the generally visually raucous atmosphere.  Very enjoyable.', '2017-08-17 18:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529432, 1203935, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely, pretty pattern of delicate foliage.  I hope it''s not an insult to say that this would make beautiful wrapping paper.  Sumptuous and serene.</td>', 'Lovely, pretty pattern of delicate foliage.  I hope it''s not an insult to say that this would make beautiful wrapping paper.  Sumptuous and serene.', '2017-08-17 18:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529433, 1203332, 173844, '<td valign="top">Such creative use of shadows.  Has the feel of a Seurat.  Innovative and rewarding.</td>', 'Such creative use of shadows.  Has the feel of a Seurat.  Innovative and rewarding.', '2017-08-17 18:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529434, 1203875, 173844, '<td valign="top">A mystery novel of an image.  The plot is murky, the clues are coyly spread about.  Nice title.  Terrific mood.</td>', 'A mystery novel of an image.  The plot is murky, the clues are coyly spread about.  Nice title.  Terrific mood.', '2017-08-17 18:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529435, 1203949, 173844, '<td valign="top">Like a dancer sallying forward for her or his solo turn, a graceful gesture.  Also, what lovely bokeh.</td>', 'Like a dancer sallying forward for her or his solo turn, a graceful gesture.  Also, what lovely bokeh.', '2017-08-17 19:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529436, 1203952, 173844, '<td valign="top">The car, metal, glass and rubber, somehow grazes peacefully in this delicate field.  Quite artfully accomplished.</td>', 'The car, metal, glass and rubber, somehow grazes peacefully in this delicate field.  Quite artfully accomplished.', '2017-08-17 19:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529438, 1203683, 173844, '<td valign="top">Strangely expressive, this scattershot of dots enveloped in chartreuse, like tadpoles in eggs, and blue, blade-like fragments.  Good title.  Feels very avant-garde.</td>', 'Strangely expressive, this scattershot of dots enveloped in chartreuse, like tadpoles in eggs, and blue, blade-like fragments.  Good title.  Feels very avant-garde.', '2017-08-17 19:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529440, 1203770, 173844, '<td valign="top">A sci-fi, apocalyptic vision, yanked violently into existence.  I especially like how we are also given a glimpse below the waterline.  Well presented.</td>', 'A sci-fi, apocalyptic vision, yanked violently into existence.  I especially like how we are also given a glimpse below the waterline.  Well presented.', '2017-08-17 19:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529442, 1203558, 173844, '<td valign="top">A perfectly observed moment of reality peeling away from imagery.  Great emphasis on the dominant green.  A capture to be cherished.</td>', 'A perfectly observed moment of reality peeling away from imagery.  Great emphasis on the dominant green.  A capture to be cherished.', '2017-08-17 19:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
